    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "No passport required! Join the National Arts Centre Orchestra for a special send-off concert in Ottawa before it departs on its tour to Korea and Japan.\n\nThis free (but ticketed) event offers a unique opportunity to connect with the Orchestra and Alexander Shelley and experience a preview of the exciting repertoire they’ll perform on their international tour.\n\n6:15 PM to 6:45 PM – Pre-Concert Performance (Free - No ticket required)\n\nBegin your evening with a delightful pre-concert performance on the NAC’s Canal Lobby Stage, featuring the young musicians from OrKidstra.\n\n7:00..."
      }
